					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Timaeus"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 409110102,
					"content": "What is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 409110101,
					"content": "...Traveler! Hi! Hold up a second...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110103,
					"content": "Okay, so... I'm sorry about this, but... there's something I really need your help with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110104,
					"content": "As you know, I've never made much progress in my alchemical studies...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110105,
					"content": "Well, I've realized that I can't keep trying the same things over and over again. Clearly, that approach is getting me nowhere.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110107,
					"content": "You're switching to bio-alchemy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 409110109,
					"content": "You're going back to the origins of the art?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 409110106,
					"content": "So, I decided I'd change focus. Take a fresh approach. Attempt something that's not been done before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110107,
						409110109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110108,
					"content": "There's nothing particularly new about bio-alchemy. There are already people researching that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110110,
					"content": "You mean study the alchemical arts of the ancients? No, that's not something I'd be able to get involved in...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110111,
					"content": "Do you know what the most important factor in alchemy is? It's the elements.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110112,
					"content": "For a number of reasons, alchemy is mostly performed using items infused with elemental energy, rather than pure elemental energy itself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110113,
					"content": "Naturally, this introduces impurities into the transmutation process, making the elemental reactions less effective...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110114,
					"content": "To compensate, we must use larger quantities of elemental materials. Even then, we still need to be very hands-on during the transmutation process, as the impurities can easily ruin the outcome.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110115,
					"content": "Unfortunately, this all creates extra costs for those who wish to perform alchemy without using Visions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110116,
					"content": "The biggest issue is that items infused with elemental energy do not come cheap.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110117,
					"content": "The bill for the average transmutation is more astonishing than the fruits of our labor...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110119,
					"content": "I don't have a Vision, either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 409110121,
					"content": "So, what do you need me to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 409110118,
					"content": "*sigh* Maybe this is why I've never made any tangible progress. The barrier to entry is just too high...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110119,
						409110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110120,
					"content": "True... But I hear you can still manipulate elemental energy, correct?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110122,
					"content": "I've heard you can manipulate elemental energy even though you don't have a Vision. Is that right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110123,
					"content": "Here's the thing: I've come up with a new kind of alchemical furnace which I call the <color=#00E1FFFF>Elemental Crucible</color>. The idea behind it is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110124,
					"content": "Well, basically, it's a vessel that can hold pure elemental energy and generate elemental reactions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110125,
					"content": "With any luck, the Elemental Crucible will be the thing that takes my alchemical skills to the next level...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110126,
					"content": "Everything is set up and ready to go. All I'm missing now is someone with the ability to actually move the pure elemental energy around.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110127,
					"content": "If you're willing to help out, please meet me at the <color=#00E1FFFF>Thousand Winds Temple</color>. That's where I had some people set everything up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						409110128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				},
				{
					"id": 409110128,
					"content": "I really hope this will be my big breakthrough in alchemy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Timaeus"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4091103,
